        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1373621068,
        "heading": "Safety",
        "text": "In the United States, guaraná fruit powder and seed extract have not been evaluated for the status of \"generally recognized as safe\" (GRAS) by the Food and Drug Administration, but rather are approved as food additives for flavor (but not non-flavor) uses.",
        "truncated": false
      }
